---
name: architecture-decision
version: 1.0.0
description: Render an architecture decision record.
required_variables: [record]
optional_variables: [references]
defaults: {references: ""}
---
# {{ record.id }}: {{ record.title }}

**Status:** {{ record.status }}
**Owner:** {{ record.document_metadata.owner }}
**ID Range:** {{ record.document_metadata.id_range }}

{% set body = record.content.markdown %}
{% set sections = ["Context", "Decision", "Rationale", "Consequences", "Alternatives Considered", "Implementation", "Impact Analysis", "Related Documents"] %}
{% if "## " in body %}{{ body }}

{% endif %}{% for section in sections %}{% if ("## " ~ section) not in body %}## {{ section }}

{% if "## " not in body and section == "Decision" %}{{ body }}

{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
